<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 6.0 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 6.0 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 6.0 trillion lire repurchase tender for today for government securities to be resold on May 2.</p>
<p>At the previous 17-day, 5.5 trillion lire operation on April 15, the minimum accepted rate stood at 7.22 percent and the average rate at 7.23 percent.</p>
